(currentObjective 0).toReal - (currentObjective (-1)).toReal ≤ support (0 - -1) - 1 / 2 * ‖0 - -1‖ ^ 2 ∧
  IsMinOn predictionObjective feasible 0 ∧
    ¬IsMinOn currentObjective feasible 0 ∧
      (∀ z ∈ feasible, (losses 0 0).toReal - hint 0 + support (z - 0) ≤ (losses 0 z).toReal - hint z) ∧
        support ≠ 0 ∧
          0 ∈ feasible ∧
            -1 ∈ feasible ∧
              2 ∉ feasible ∧
                currentObjective 0 = 0 ∧
                  currentObjective (-1) = ↑(-(1 / 2)) ∧
                    currentObjective 2 = ⊤ ∧
                      (currentObjective 0).toReal - (currentObjective (-1)).toReal = 1 / 2 ∧
                        support (0 - -1) - 1 / 2 * ‖0 - -1‖ ^ 2 = 1 / 2 : Prop
